/*
  VehicleTwin.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0235 · VehicleTwin (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "VehicleTwin").
  Every string the native VehicleTwin surface resolves lives here with its web
  English value, so the Swift sources hold no hardcoded prose. These entries fold
  into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they
  are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own
  strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The web source (web/src/components/vehicles/VehicleTwin.tsx) is anonymous (it
  renders no headings) and hardcodes its region/state labels (windowLabel,
  stateLabel, the InteractiveHotspot/title labels, the aria-label) plus the paint
  names from web/src/lib/vehicleColors.ts. The first group reproduces those
  verbatim; the second group backs the native P4 leaf chrome + the always-visible
  status legend (a native-idiomatic peer of the web hover tooltips).
*/

